  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Development and Institutions (EDI) research programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To produce a body of research evidence and analysis indicating practical ways of changing institutions so as to increase economic growth in poor countries. This will enable a better understanding of how institutions improve and change economic performances, and by 2020 developing countries will be able to use this understanding to improve their economies through developing better institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
